  {
    "id": 4001014080010,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "あーあ！　負けた負けた！\r\n大口叩いといてこれよ、ざまぁないったら！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0015",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400101408/4001014080010"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001014080011,
    "speaker": "あさひ＆愛依",
    "text": "……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0015",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400101408/4001014080011"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001014080020,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "でも、一番点数が高かったのは冬優子ちゃんっす",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0015",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400101408/4001014080020"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001014080030,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "そうそう！\r\n歌も、最初のMCもめっちゃヤバかったし！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0015",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400101408/4001014080030"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001014080040,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "だとしても、負けてんの\r\nそれが今のふゆたちの実力ってことでしょ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0015",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400101408/4001014080040"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001014080050,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "ムカつくけど、ズルしたやつらを黙らせられるほどの\r\nステージじゃなかったってこと",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0015",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400101408/4001014080050"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001014080060,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "それは受け止めとかないとね\r\n──ムカつくけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0015",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400101408/4001014080060"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001014080070,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "サバサバしてるわー冬優子ちゃん\r\nすごくね？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0015",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400101408/4001014080070"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001014080080,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "どうだか\r\nふゆ、あいつらいつかぶちのめすって思ってるけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0015",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400101408/4001014080080"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001014080090,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "ひえ～それは激ヤバ～～\r\n実はバチバチってわけだ！　ギョーカイ人～～",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0015",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400101408/4001014080090"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001014080100,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "業界人はあんたもでしょ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0015",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400101408/4001014080100"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001014080110,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
